    "Off hides them all and stops their shortcuts. Uncheck one below to hide just that one." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "关闭后将隐藏全部项目并停用快捷键。取消勾选下方某一项可只隐藏该项。" } } } },
    "Off sends nothing ahead of your message, not even what Tinycast says about itself." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "关闭后，在你的消息之前不会发送任何内容，包括 Tinycast 的自我说明。" } } } },
    "Older conversations are deleted permanently." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "更早的对话会被永久删除。" } } } },
