    "Your home folder expands to its visible folders and cloud drives, never to its Library. An empty list searches nothing." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "个人文件夹会展开到可见文件夹和云盘，但不会展开到资源库。列表为空时不搜索任何位置。" } } } },
